-- 10a. floor gaps (carter 10-15 "the gap on the map floor"; raycast scan: 764 grey spots): the meadow ground ends at
-- z -175 and x +-147, so the grey collision floor showed along the south wall and in slivers by the side cliffs. One
-- green filler slab just under the meadow top (0.1 lower, so no z-fight) covers the whole walled area.
do
